(7373332, 1156987, 12611, '<td valign="top">I was in Manhattan on Sunday, riding the dubway, thinking of your shots, shooting from the hip.<br/> <br/>I love the mystery here, were they aware? How could they not be? But so natural. You are part of the scene.</td>', 'I was in Manhattan on Sunday, riding the dubway, thinking of your shots, shooting from the hip. I love the mystery here, were they aware? How could they not be? But so natural. You are part of the scene.', '2015-06-26 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
