(7373344, 1156725, 12611, '<td valign="top">What are dogs thinking? Pondering some vasty philosophical argument as to the nature of cats, the utility of honor and loyalty in the context of companionship, perhaps, but most likely living in the moment enjoying the light, the sounds and simply being.</td>', 'What are dogs thinking? Pondering some vasty philosophical argument as to the nature of cats, the utility of honor and loyalty in the context of companionship, perhaps, but most likely living in the moment enjoying the light, the sounds and simply being.', '2015-06-26 08:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
