(7373566, 1155974, 138253, '<td valign="top">the glow really adds a level of warmth to this image, it takes it from being a snapshot at the pier and gives it the feeling of looking back at a memory you care about.<br/>I can''t think of any other words to describe the feeling this invokes in me. :)<br/>8</td>', 'the glow really adds a level of warmth to this image, it takes it from being a snapshot at the pier and gives it the feeling of looking back at a memory you care about.I can''t think of any other words to describe the feeling this invokes in me. :)8', '2015-06-26 12:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373568, 1155699, 138253, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I laughed out loud when this image loaded. it''s just so... so..... incredulous and incredible. it borders on the absurd and makes lite of what is and what should be by denying an entire facet. you have proclaimed that you''ve reached the end. there is no more east. you can go back west where you came from, or you can go north/south, but you''ve literally reached the wall, the impasse, and everything is telling you you''re done.<br/>I love it.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I laughed out loud when this image loaded. it''s just so... so..... incredulous and incredible. it borders on the absurd and makes lite of what is and what should be by denying an entire facet. you have proclaimed that you''ve reached the end. there is no more east. you can go back west where you came from, or you can go north/south, but you''ve literally reached the wall, the impasse, and everything is telling you you''re done.I love it.', '2015-06-26 12:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
