(7373577, 1155352, 138253, '<td valign="top">I keep finding myself coming back to this image over and over, not because it''s yours, but because it demands repeat viewings. I look at this and I keep looking for the name of the book or the author, it has that sense of innocence/innocence lost that you only really see the difference after going through the events with the people (characters). I''m sure this is very un-DPC, but that doesn''t mean it''s not a good image in- and of-itself.</td>', 'I keep finding myself coming back to this image over and over, not because it''s yours, but because it demands repeat viewings. I look at this and I keep looking for the name of the book or the author, it has that sense of innocence/innocence lost that you only really see the difference after going through the events with the people (characters). I''m sure this is very un-DPC, but that doesn''t mean it''s not a good image in- and of-itself.', '2015-06-26 13:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
