(7373917, 1155049, 94815, '<td valign="top">Painfully engaging.</td>', 'Painfully engaging.', '2015-06-27 01:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373918, 1156721, 94815, '<td valign="top">For dog lovers and friends.What eyes.</td>', 'For dog lovers and friends.What eyes.', '2015-06-27 01:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373919, 1156706, 94815, '<td valign="top">This bears some explanation. Beautifully captured and processed. voted earlier</td>', 'This bears some explanation. Beautifully captured and processed. voted earlier', '2015-06-27 01:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373950, 1156979, 30982, '<td valign="top">I remember you from the bird challenge this year - you''re quite accomplished!  The part I love about this is the urban nature of it.  A stunning sky, but a mundane setting.  I have something I did in Texas this reminds me of.</td>', 'I remember you from the bird challenge this year - you''re quite accomplished!  The part I love about this is the urban nature of it.  A stunning sky, but a mundane setting.  I have something I did in Texas this reminds me of.', '2015-06-27 02:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373951, 1157033, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is so very much you.   Makes me smile.  You manage to get in amongst your people to capture them as they are and they are none the wiser.  Well, except perhaps for the slightly concerned looking woman in the back (in running shoes) who may have spotted you.  That''s another thing - I love all the different shoes.</td>', 'This is so very much you.   Makes me smile.  You manage to get in amongst your people to capture them as they are and they are none the wiser.  Well, except perhaps for the slightly concerned looking woman in the back (in running shoes) who may have spotted you.  That''s another thing - I love all the different shoes.', '2015-06-27 02:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373952, 1156737, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely and soft, nice detail!  You do have a nice touch with flowers.</td>', 'Lovely and soft, nice detail!  You do have a nice touch with flowers.', '2015-06-27 02:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373953, 1156978, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on your username, I think.  I''m guessing you''re a landscape photographer who is also a musician!</td>', 'An interesting take on your username, I think.  I''m guessing you''re a landscape photographer who is also a musician!', '2015-06-27 02:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373954, 1156955, 30982, '<td valign="top">This made me smile!!  How odd, delightful, and fun all at the same time.  He''s still quite the ham, but with more skills.  And I still love this one:  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=995975" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1517/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_995975.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1517/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_995975.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1517/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_995975.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This made me smile!!  How odd, delightful, and fun all at the same time.  He''s still quite the ham, but with more skills.  And I still love this one:  ', '2015-06-27 02:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373955, 1156985, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, this may be a stretch, but I actually see an alligator in the cloud formation!  Suits you well.</td>', 'OK, this may be a stretch, but I actually see an alligator in the cloud formation!  Suits you well.', '2015-06-27 02:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373956, 1156890, 30982, '<td valign="top">I LOVE blurry trees.  This reminds me of one I did of trees in snow in Germany, only of course much warmer, and in color.  You do this so well!</td>', 'I LOVE blurry trees.  This reminds me of one I did of trees in snow in Germany, only of course much warmer, and in color.  You do this so well!', '2015-06-27 02:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373958, 1156916, 30982, '<td valign="top">A wizardess wanders the forest!  Is there such a thing as a wizardess??  I almost want this just a little tigher, but I love the light on your model and the glowy balloons.</td>', 'A wizardess wanders the forest!  Is there such a thing as a wizardess??  I almost want this just a little tigher, but I love the light on your model and the glowy balloons.', '2015-06-27 02:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373959, 1156725, 30982, '<td valign="top">Who else but you with your beautiful pups!  The light is gorgeous (as is the dog.)</td>', 'Who else but you with your beautiful pups!  The light is gorgeous (as is the dog.)', '2015-06-27 02:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373960, 1156787, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice sunset - I do like the wee bit of flare near the sun - things always go better with a little lens flare.</td>', 'A nice sunset - I do like the wee bit of flare near the sun - things always go better with a little lens flare.', '2015-06-27 02:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373961, 1157000, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the wispy fur and those wide, wide eyes!  A bit mushy in the fur, as though it''s a low fidelity image.  You lose some of the detail in that lovely black fur.</td>', 'Love the wispy fur and those wide, wide eyes!  A bit mushy in the fur, as though it''s a low fidelity image.  You lose some of the detail in that lovely black fur.', '2015-06-27 02:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373962, 1156928, 30982, '<td valign="top">The softness works here to create a soothing, relaxing feel to the photo.</td>', 'The softness works here to create a soothing, relaxing feel to the photo.', '2015-06-27 02:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373964, 1156877, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has suprising movement to it, as though I can actually see it moving.  Nice Lensbaby or tilt-shift to create a magical, miniature world.  Not something I would have normally associated with your username, but I like it.</td>', 'This has suprising movement to it, as though I can actually see it moving.  Nice Lensbaby or tilt-shift to create a magical, miniature world.  Not something I would have normally associated with your username, but I like it.', '2015-06-27 02:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373966, 1157025, 30982, '<td valign="top">What magical light!  I love all the dandelions - reminds me of southern Germany.</td>', 'What magical light!  I love all the dandelions - reminds me of southern Germany.', '2015-06-27 02:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373977, 1155438, 115814, '<td valign="top">From the makers of Marsupial Merlot. Fun!</td>', 'From the makers of Marsupial Merlot. Fun!', '2015-06-27 02:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373978, 1156987, 115814, '<td valign="top">What stories behind those eyes. A timely catch. Nice!</td>', 'What stories behind those eyes. A timely catch. Nice!', '2015-06-27 02:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373979, 1155187, 115814, '<td valign="top">Is he holding a camera / camera phone, or making a boxing gesture at the gulls? Either way it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Is he holding a camera / camera phone, or making a boxing gesture at the gulls? Either way it''s a great shot.', '2015-06-27 03:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373980, 1156753, 115814, '<td valign="top">Yep. Definitely (one of) your style(s). Seems a little busier than your usual water shots - perhaps the combination of ripples on the water and the dense background foliage in the upper third of the shot. But, as usual, what stunning color and light!</td>', 'Yep. Definitely (one of) your style(s). Seems a little busier than your usual water shots - perhaps the combination of ripples on the water and the dense background foliage in the upper third of the shot. But, as usual, what stunning color and light!', '2015-06-27 03:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373981, 1156247, 115814, '<td valign="top">Man or beast? Wow.</td>', 'Man or beast? Wow.', '2015-06-27 03:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373983, 1156891, 115814, '<td valign="top">Good lines in the sky and even though it''s small the paddler stands out as a clear subject. I''d like to see this with a bit less saturation and a bit more luminance, but that''s a personal taste kinda thing. Nice.</td>', 'Good lines in the sky and even though it''s small the paddler stands out as a clear subject. I''d like to see this with a bit less saturation and a bit more luminance, but that''s a personal taste kinda thing. Nice.', '2015-06-27 03:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373984, 1155334, 115814, '<td valign="top">Very effective juxtaposition of observers and observed.</td>', 'Very effective juxtaposition of observers and observed.', '2015-06-27 03:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373985, 1157015, 115814, '<td valign="top">Rockwell channeling to a "T", with a small corner of modernity for effect in the lower right. Nice.</td>', 'Rockwell channeling to a "T", with a small corner of modernity for effect in the lower right. Nice.', '2015-06-27 03:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373986, 1156934, 115814, '<td valign="top">I always like seeing a sunset with foreground interest. Nice.</td>', 'I always like seeing a sunset with foreground interest. Nice.', '2015-06-27 03:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7373987, 1156725, 115814, '<td valign="top">Effective natural backlighting, I presume, and such a great capture of the intensely focused attention on who or whatever is outside the frame to the right. Bravo.</td>', 'Effective natural backlighting, I presume, and such a great capture of the intensely focused attention on who or whatever is outside the frame to the right. Bravo.', '2015-06-27 03:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374035, 1155334, 113591, '<td valign="top">Easy 10. She and you sharing he inside joke you have on him.</td>', 'Easy 10. She and you sharing he inside joke you have on him.', '2015-06-27 08:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374036, 1156560, 113591, '<td valign="top">Man, you''re good. It suits everything, even your username.</td>', 'Man, you''re good. It suits everything, even your username.', '2015-06-27 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374037, 1157033, 113591, '<td valign="top">You are often so generally specific. Brilliant.</td>', 'You are often so generally specific. Brilliant.', '2015-06-27 08:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374038, 1156955, 113591, '<td valign="top">Weird, to the uninformed. With perfect processing. Of course it is you. Top 5.</td>', 'Weird, to the uninformed. With perfect processing. Of course it is you. Top 5.', '2015-06-27 08:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374039, 1155049, 113591, '<td valign="top">The clearest you have been for a while, and even more to consider. Thanks.</td>', 'The clearest you have been for a while, and even more to consider. Thanks.', '2015-06-27 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374040, 1156164, 113591, '<td valign="top">You will always be underappreciated, as you are so good, with no big fanfare of an idea needed. But just feel the life in this image. Waiting to continue. Thanks.</td>', 'You will always be underappreciated, as you are so good, with no big fanfare of an idea needed. But just feel the life in this image. Waiting to continue. Thanks.', '2015-06-27 08:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374041, 1155284, 113591, '<td valign="top">What an eye you have. Your viewpoints pull one inside the heart of the image. Thanks.</td>', 'What an eye you have. Your viewpoints pull one inside the heart of the image. Thanks.', '2015-06-27 08:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374042, 1156890, 113591, '<td valign="top">Wondrous. An outsider seeing the life force. Your best to date.</td>', 'Wondrous. An outsider seeing the life force. Your best to date.', '2015-06-27 08:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374043, 1155352, 113591, '<td valign="top">You are fearless. Please stay this way.<br/> <br/>This is so incomplete. So many questions. Thanks.</td>', 'You are fearless. Please stay this way. This is so incomplete. So many questions. Thanks.', '2015-06-27 09:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374057, 1155284, 114285, '<td valign="top">I guess this is what happens when dad  attends youth camps ;)</td>', 'I guess this is what happens when dad  attends youth camps ;)', '2015-06-27 09:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374058, 1156477, 114285, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong but this doesn''t  seem to be your normal style.</td>', 'I could be wrong but this doesn''t  seem to be your normal style.', '2015-06-27 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374061, 1156784, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hey I''m disappointed you''re not in your usual garb what''s going on ;-))<br/> <br/>Btw I see this is on your profile page also, but I guess it doesn''t really matter.</td>', 'Hey I''m disappointed you''re not in your usual garb what''s going on ;-)) Btw I see this is on your profile page also, but I guess it doesn''t really matter.', '2015-06-27 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374062, 1156877, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very tomish!</td>', 'Very tomish!', '2015-06-27 10:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374066, 1155352, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very well judged.  Making the everyday mundane interesting.  Thanks for staying true and not bending towards the safe and status quo.</td>', 'Very well judged.  Making the everyday mundane interesting.  Thanks for staying true and not bending towards the safe and status quo.', '2015-06-27 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7374068, 1156784, 16148, '<td valign="top">Hardly ever see your self-portrait without expert editing.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Hardly ever see your self-portrait without expert editing.  Nicely done!', '2015-06-27 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374069, 1156987, 16148, '<td valign="top">Brilliant Mark!  Love this series you''ve been building.</td>', 'Brilliant Mark!  Love this series you''ve been building.', '2015-06-27 10:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374071, 1155334, 16148, '<td valign="top">No name needed for this one.  Looking at the looking as an art.  Not sure I like the blue/purple complementary glow.  Nice!</td>', 'No name needed for this one.  Looking at the looking as an art.  Not sure I like the blue/purple complementary glow.  Nice!', '2015-06-27 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374076, 1156651, 177322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and colors.  The beads of water add a perfect, subtle accent.</td>', 'Beautiful lines and colors.  The beads of water add a perfect, subtle accent.', '2015-06-27 11:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374078, 1156573, 177322, '<td valign="top">The toads in my garden would not be such willing models.  The spell you cast on your toadies to get them to pose is truly amazing.  Thanks for sharing another handsome one with us.</td>', 'The toads in my garden would not be such willing models.  The spell you cast on your toadies to get them to pose is truly amazing.  Thanks for sharing another handsome one with us.', '2015-06-27 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374081, 1156978, 177322, '<td valign="top">Mountain music: A most thoughtful mix of subjects.  Very creative.</td>', 'Mountain music: A most thoughtful mix of subjects.  Very creative.', '2015-06-27 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374084, 1155284, 100831, '<td valign="top">an engaging trio, your family portraits rock.</td>', 'an engaging trio, your family portraits rock.', '2015-06-27 11:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374085, 1155974, 177322, '<td valign="top">Pure joy.  I smiled when I saw this family enjoying themselves.  Perhaps you have added an Orton Effect?  If so, it is a beautiful enhancement.</td>', 'Pure joy.  I smiled when I saw this family enjoying themselves.  Perhaps you have added an Orton Effect?  If so, it is a beautiful enhancement.', '2015-06-27 11:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374087, 1156737, 100831, '<td valign="top">lovely.. soft, but with just enough detail to make it beautiful.. I can almost smell it.</td>', 'lovely.. soft, but with just enough detail to make it beautiful.. I can almost smell it.', '2015-06-27 11:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374090, 1156858, 100831, '<td valign="top">captivating as always... the stories continue</td>', 'captivating as always... the stories continue', '2015-06-27 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374093, 1156508, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love how you worked the layers.  A perfect blend of beauty and horror. I could see this hanging up very large. <br/>What a vision you have.</td>', 'I love how you worked the layers.  A perfect blend of beauty and horror. I could see this hanging up very large. What a vision you have.', '2015-06-27 11:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374098, 1155514, 100831, '<td valign="top">I guess this should not be unexpected from you, but that was my first reaction. I think if I break it down in pieces (lines, textures, form, beauty) it is what you do best, but the end result here is rather startling... and I mean that in a good way. That light (window) is fantastic.</td>', 'I guess this should not be unexpected from you, but that was my first reaction. I think if I break it down in pieces (lines, textures, form, beauty) it is what you do best, but the end result here is rather startling... and I mean that in a good way. That light (window) is fantastic.', '2015-06-27 11:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374099, 1155438, 100831, '<td valign="top">jumping for joy!</td>', 'jumping for joy!', '2015-06-27 11:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374100, 1156651, 100831, '<td valign="top">Classic, I love the way you filled the frame. Great picture.</td>', 'Classic, I love the way you filled the frame. Great picture.', '2015-06-27 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374101, 1156711, 100831, '<td valign="top">You out did yourself - this looks scrumptious - love the dof.</td>', 'You out did yourself - this looks scrumptious - love the dof.', '2015-06-27 11:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374104, 1155334, 100831, '<td valign="top">I have to marvel at how you find the perfect subjects... and they''re always in the same room!</td>', 'I have to marvel at how you find the perfect subjects... and they''re always in the same room!', '2015-06-27 11:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374106, 1157012, 100831, '<td valign="top">A tour de force! Well shot.</td>', 'A tour de force! Well shot.', '2015-06-27 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374109, 1156468, 100831, '<td valign="top">this kind of makes me start stuttering (that''s a joke) ... love the infinite repetition and the golden glow! A wonderful shot.</td>', 'this kind of makes me start stuttering (that''s a joke) ... love the infinite repetition and the golden glow! A wonderful shot.', '2015-06-27 11:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374114, 1156868, 100831, '<td valign="top">Capturing life. That''s what it''s all about:)</td>', 'Capturing life. That''s what it''s all about:)', '2015-06-27 11:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374127, 1156247, 177322, '<td valign="top">Jeepers!  I hope that is make-up and not the real deal.  Ouch.  A most unique interpretation for this challenge.  The graininess of the processing is effective.</td>', 'Jeepers!  I hope that is make-up and not the real deal.  Ouch.  A most unique interpretation for this challenge.  The graininess of the processing is effective.', '2015-06-27 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374133, 1156337, 177322, '<td valign="top">A lovely natural scene.  Those mulberries, despite not being ripe, certainly must be sweet enough for this little bird.  What a mouthful!</td>', 'A lovely natural scene.  Those mulberries, despite not being ripe, certainly must be sweet enough for this little bird.  What a mouthful!', '2015-06-27 12:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374138, 1156310, 177322, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww - too sweet.  Your love of critters comes through your images, and I always enjoy them.</td>', 'Awwwwww - too sweet.  Your love of critters comes through your images, and I always enjoy them.', '2015-06-27 12:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374142, 1155653, 177322, '<td valign="top">As always, creative and thought provoking.  I especially like the balance of the black and white. The play of the lines in the white space is intriquing.</td>', 'As always, creative and thought provoking.  I especially like the balance of the black and white. The play of the lines in the white space is intriquing.', '2015-06-27 12:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374145, 1156144, 177322, '<td valign="top">The wonder.  The innocence.  What a beautiful baby.</td>', 'The wonder.  The innocence.  What a beautiful baby.', '2015-06-27 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374148, 1155221, 177322, '<td valign="top">Exquisitely delicate.  Beautiful colors and composition.  I like that you have the three phases of the flower:  two that have already bloomed and dropped the petals, the one in full flower, and the bud about to pop - the cycle of life.</td>', 'Exquisitely delicate.  Beautiful colors and composition.  I like that you have the three phases of the flower:  two that have already bloomed and dropped the petals, the one in full flower, and the bud about to pop - the cycle of life.', '2015-06-27 12:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374151, 1157024, 16148, '<td valign="top">Fascinating nature abstract.  Reminds me of selective desaturation but yours is as found.  Nice!</td>', 'Fascinating nature abstract.  Reminds me of selective desaturation but yours is as found.  Nice!', '2015-06-27 12:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374153, 1156929, 177322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pastel colors.  The texture really enhances the whole subject from the grasses, to the dragonfly, and of course the heron.  The stripes formed by the water highlights is a befitting BG. Quite lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful pastel colors.  The texture really enhances the whole subject from the grasses, to the dragonfly, and of course the heron.  The stripes formed by the water highlights is a befitting BG. Quite lovely.', '2015-06-27 12:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
