(7374605, 1156929, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice artistic approach - I do like the canvas texture, but I especially like the dragonfly!</td>', 'A nice artistic approach - I do like the canvas texture, but I especially like the dragonfly!', '2015-06-28 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374606, 1155221, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp focus on yor open bloom, good composition, and I quite like the poppies creeping in upper left.  Maybe just a tad brighter?</td>', 'Nice crisp focus on yor open bloom, good composition, and I quite like the poppies creeping in upper left.  Maybe just a tad brighter?', '2015-06-28 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374607, 1156038, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is such a warm, honest portrait!  Worth framing, for sure.  Well done.</td>', 'This is such a warm, honest portrait!  Worth framing, for sure.  Well done.', '2015-06-28 01:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374609, 1156860, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Quite delightful with those awesome eyes and flyaway hair!</td>', 'Ha!  Quite delightful with those awesome eyes and flyaway hair!', '2015-06-28 01:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374610, 1156573, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well of COURSE it''s an amphibian!  Poor guy is probably thinking "I so know better than to be out when she''s got a challenge due... the LEAST, the very LEAST she could do is provide crickets at the end of these modeling sessions.  But no.... Just back out to the pond until the next time."  I see all that from this picture.  Really.</td>', 'Well of COURSE it''s an amphibian!  Poor guy is probably thinking "I so know better than to be out when she''s got a challenge due... the LEAST, the very LEAST she could do is provide crickets at the end of these modeling sessions.  But no.... Just back out to the pond until the next time."  I see all that from this picture.  Really.', '2015-06-28 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374611, 1156934, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wowza!  That really pops when it opens up on the screen.  Best part is the groupe of wee little people out there way beyond the lighthouse.</td>', 'Wowza!  That really pops when it opens up on the screen.  Best part is the groupe of wee little people out there way beyond the lighthouse.', '2015-06-28 01:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374612, 1156983, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely late light!  But jsust a wee bit too "crispy" for my taste.</td>', 'Lovely late light!  But jsust a wee bit too "crispy" for my taste.', '2015-06-28 01:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374613, 1155653, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s the white rabbit, and he''s got a typewriter - deadline coming up.  Based on your more recent work, I wouldn''t associate you with blur, bu tthis is nice!  (You do need to clean your sensor, though!)</td>', 'It''s the white rabbit, and he''s got a typewriter - deadline coming up.  Based on your more recent work, I wouldn''t associate you with blur, bu tthis is nice!  (You do need to clean your sensor, though!)', '2015-06-28 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374614, 1155187, 30982, '<td valign="top">This warms my heart - what a wonderful shot!  You normally do very good work - this is even better.</td>', 'This warms my heart - what a wonderful shot!  You normally do very good work - this is even better.', '2015-06-28 01:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374615, 1156750, 30982, '<td valign="top">I tend to think of you more as a people photographer than a nature photographer, but maybe because that''s what I remember more - in looking at your portfolio, you do a lot of other types of photography as well!</td>', 'I tend to think of you more as a people photographer than a nature photographer, but maybe because that''s what I remember more - in looking at your portfolio, you do a lot of other types of photography as well!', '2015-06-28 01:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7374616, 1156508, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where you found this, but it''s quite amazing!  Quite fun to sit and explore.</td>', 'I don''t know where you found this, but it''s quite amazing!  Quite fun to sit and explore.', '2015-06-28 01:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
