(7374765, 1155438, 177322, '<td valign="top">Perfectly centered works so well on this - oh! I just noticed the kangaroo on the right edge of the frame.  While it may be a common sight for you, most of don''t have the opportunity to see kangaroos hopping around in a vineyard, so this is very unique - almost a fantasy.  In fact, the dreamlike quality created by the heavy mist lends to an other world impression. One of my faves in this challenge.</td>', 'Perfectly centered works so well on this - oh! I just noticed the kangaroo on the right edge of the frame.  While it may be a common sight for you, most of don''t have the opportunity to see kangaroos hopping around in a vineyard, so this is very unique - almost a fantasy.  In fact, the dreamlike quality created by the heavy mist lends to an other world impression. One of my faves in this challenge.', '2015-06-28 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
