(7375557, 1155244, 86447, '<td valign="top">Dang it, Mike!<br/> <br/>I love this!  LOL!<br/> <br/>I wonder how many people will give you a one or a two... because of your voting habits and telling about them.<br/> <br/>If I were voting... and I''m not... I''d give this an eight.<br/> <br/>It''s totally charming and lovely.   Just what I think of you when I read your comments on the forums... until I see your votes on my images.  <br/> <br/>LOL!!<br/> <br/> <br/>LOL again!<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m truly only kidding... but I fear that the others who know your voting habits will vote your wonderful image down... because... they "know".<br/> <br/>Regardless... THIS is lovely.<br/> <br/>Moody and serene.<br/> <br/>I love it.</td>', 'Dang it, Mike! I love this!  LOL! I wonder how many people will give you a one or a two... because of your voting habits and telling about them. If I were voting... and I''m not... I''d give this an eight. It''s totally charming and lovely.   Just what I think of you when I read your comments on the forums... until I see your votes on my images.   LOL!!  LOL again!  I''m truly only kidding... but I fear that the others who know your voting habits will vote your wonderful image down... because... they "know". Regardless... THIS is lovely. Moody and serene. I love it.', '2015-06-29 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
