(7376327, 1156916, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the magical whimsy of this piece. The young woman in blue stands in an enchanted wood where colorful balloons glow with magical light. Three are aloft in the air and she waits for them to come down into her open arms. This has a storybook feel to it. Well done!</td>', 'Love the magical whimsy of this piece. The young woman in blue stands in an enchanted wood where colorful balloons glow with magical light. Three are aloft in the air and she waits for them to come down into her open arms. This has a storybook feel to it. Well done!', '2015-06-29 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
