(7377119, 1156337, 30982, '<td valign="top">It appears from looking at your portfolio that you quite enjoy wildlife photography!  I especially like your recent alligator having lunch shot.  :-)  Good pose from your subject here but a bit "mushy" - either too close of a crop or just missed the focus a bit.  I do like that you caught him having snagged a snack.</td>', 'It appears from looking at your portfolio that you quite enjoy wildlife photography!  I especially like your recent alligator having lunch shot.  :-)  Good pose from your subject here but a bit "mushy" - either too close of a crop or just missed the focus a bit.  I do like that you caught him having snagged a snack.', '2015-06-29 23:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
