(7377140, 1156393, 30982, '<td valign="top">You have such a wonderful way of seeing.  I suspect these two are just making their first acquaintaince, and both just a bit wary.  Either than or they''re old friends and catching up.  Either way, it''s nice to peek into the day from just beyond the fence.</td>', 'You have such a wonderful way of seeing.  I suspect these two are just making their first acquaintaince, and both just a bit wary.  Either than or they''re old friends and catching up.  Either way, it''s nice to peek into the day from just beyond the fence.', '2015-06-29 23:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377145, 1156082, 30982, '<td valign="top">In checking your portfolio, I see lots of ribbons with marvelous northern lights.  I like this soft gentle landscape - seems so quiet and unobtrusive in comparison.</td>', 'In checking your portfolio, I see lots of ribbons with marvelous northern lights.  I like this soft gentle landscape - seems so quiet and unobtrusive in comparison.', '2015-06-29 23:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377148, 1156023, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  Most of your porfolio is clean and crisp, yet here we have this beautiful blur!  I really like, for lack of a more technical term, the squigglies in blue and the scratches upper left - not sure why, I just do!  Nice depth to the image, pretty good balance, too!</td>', 'Interesting!  Most of your porfolio is clean and crisp, yet here we have this beautiful blur!  I really like, for lack of a more technical term, the squigglies in blue and the scratches upper left - not sure why, I just do!  Nice depth to the image, pretty good balance, too!', '2015-06-29 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377149, 1157020, 30982, '<td valign="top">That you do.  Nice dot-to-dot ring light thing you got going!  Though you''re one handsome fella, that kid of yours is more photogenic.  :-)</td>', 'That you do.  Nice dot-to-dot ring light thing you got going!  Though you''re one handsome fella, that kid of yours is more photogenic.  :-)', '2015-06-29 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
