(7377163, 1156651, 30982, '<td valign="top">If Shez (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sherpet</a>) were still here, I''d have sworn this was hers.  I see you''re fairly new to DPC - take a moment to visit Shez''s profile page here - she was a dear (and a fellow Aussie).  You have a wonderful eye - I look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'If Shez ( sherpet) were still here, I''d have sworn this was hers.  I see you''re fairly new to DPC - take a moment to visit Shez''s profile page here - she was a dear (and a fellow Aussie).  You have a wonderful eye - I look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2015-06-29 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
