(7377858, 1156730, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W tones. Great close-up of the musicians playing the instruments; it brings your audience closer to the instruments that are being played showing off the lines &amp; details of the guitar and cello as well as bringing us closer to the action. Nicely framed and well captured.</td>', 'Great B&W tones. Great close-up of the musicians playing the instruments; it brings your audience closer to the instruments that are being played showing off the lines & details of the guitar and cello as well as bringing us closer to the action. Nicely framed and well captured.', '2015-06-30 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377863, 1156711, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition of this delicious looking dessert. Love the rich reds of the cherry and the topping that just draws my eye in. It makes me search for the spoon to take a taste.</td>', 'Great color and composition of this delicious looking dessert. Love the rich reds of the cherry and the topping that just draws my eye in. It makes me search for the spoon to take a taste.', '2015-06-30 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377880, 1156721, 61396, '<td valign="top">Hey <strike>Sophie</strike> Darcy, <br/>Though we have got your whisker in sharp focus, it is your inquisitive out of focus gaze that makes this interesting. That, and the background that I''m struggling to figure out. <br/>Just so that you know.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-07-03 02:01:24.</i></td>', 'Hey Sophie Darcy, Though we have got your whisker in sharp focus, it is your inquisitive out of focus gaze that makes this interesting. That, and the background that I''m struggling to figure out. Just so that you know.', '2015-06-30 17:33:41.000000', '2015-07-03 03:01:24.000000', 1),
(7377897, 1156164, 177322, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W with the vignette make this feel like and old picture but the new bike and modern building make it feel modern.  Interesting portrayal.</td>', 'The B&W with the vignette make this feel like and old picture but the new bike and modern building make it feel modern.  Interesting portrayal.', '2015-06-30 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377900, 1156730, 177322, '<td valign="top">Fabulous tones. With the subject being the instruments and hands, it makes for a unique interpretation rather than the emphasis on the players.</td>', 'Fabulous tones. With the subject being the instruments and hands, it makes for a unique interpretation rather than the emphasis on the players.', '2015-06-30 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377905, 1156468, 177322, '<td valign="top">The diagonal line is powerful.  I like the sunny reflection and the dark BG sky.</td>', 'The diagonal line is powerful.  I like the sunny reflection and the dark BG sky.', '2015-06-30 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377906, 1156106, 177322, '<td valign="top">Fairy-like.</td>', 'Fairy-like.', '2015-06-30 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377908, 1156737, 177322, '<td valign="top">Delicate.  Soft.  I can almost smell it.  Simply beautiful.</td>', 'Delicate.  Soft.  I can almost smell it.  Simply beautiful.', '2015-06-30 17:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377913, 1156853, 177322, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh!  How much fun is this?! The "curly" treatment you have subtly applied is so perfect.  Methinks you are lucky s/he did not blow slime all over your camera.  :-)</td>', 'Oh my gosh!  How much fun is this?! The "curly" treatment you have subtly applied is so perfect.  Methinks you are lucky s/he did not blow slime all over your camera.  :-)', '2015-06-30 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377914, 1157012, 177322, '<td valign="top">The power and action of this shot is tremendous. Great catch.</td>', 'The power and action of this shot is tremendous. Great catch.', '2015-06-30 17:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377917, 1156983, 177322, '<td valign="top">Marvelously effective framing. I like that you have captured a sense of anticipation for the surfing.</td>', 'Marvelously effective framing. I like that you have captured a sense of anticipation for the surfing.', '2015-06-30 17:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7377919, 1156965, 177322, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing patterns.</td>', 'Quite intriguing patterns.', '2015-06-30 17:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378210, 1156468, 83313, '<td valign="top">Totally fits. This bridge has done well for you many times.</td>', 'Totally fits. This bridge has done well for you many times.', '2015-06-30 22:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378693, 1156965, 170018, '<td valign="top">Awesome light and fascinating patterns! I also like how water is different on left and right.</td>', 'Awesome light and fascinating patterns! I also like how water is different on left and right.', '2015-07-01 01:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378699, 1156873, 170018, '<td valign="top">Summer freedom! I love how you left out what the girl is playing with, makes one wonder...</td>', 'Summer freedom! I love how you left out what the girl is playing with, makes one wonder...', '2015-07-01 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378701, 1155244, 170018, '<td valign="top">Fog never fails, and the greens are delicate, and the trees form a nice arch... Very peaceful and beautiful!</td>', 'Fog never fails, and the greens are delicate, and the trees form a nice arch... Very peaceful and beautiful!', '2015-07-01 02:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378705, 1157027, 170018, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, nice composition! Very handsome.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, nice composition! Very handsome.', '2015-07-01 02:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378706, 1155284, 170018, '<td valign="top">Timfy, I love your kids photos! Are they just so used to you with a camera, that react to it so naturally (or better say, do not react on it)? It''s so interesting to see them grow...<br/>It''s another great shot with an awesome feeling in it. Love the guy in the back, who looks like he''s ready to fall asleep...Crop is super!<br/>Whole scene reminds me the episode from "Moonrise Kingdom". :-)</td>', 'Timfy, I love your kids photos! Are they just so used to you with a camera, that react to it so naturally (or better say, do not react on it)? It''s so interesting to see them grow...It''s another great shot with an awesome feeling in it. Love the guy in the back, who looks like he''s ready to fall asleep...Crop is super!Whole scene reminds me the episode from "Moonrise Kingdom". :-)', '2015-07-01 02:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378718, 1156881, 170018, '<td valign="top">You are great capturing this mundane life''s rituals. Love the interior details here - clock,  TV, floor...<br/>Also love your other subject - white cat!</td>', 'You are great capturing this mundane life''s rituals. Love the interior details here - clock,  TV, floor...Also love your other subject - white cat!', '2015-07-01 02:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378944, 1156393, 12611, '<td valign="top">so much wonderful in the frame- smooth and dark and blur and emotion and random chaos and compositional order.</td>', 'so much wonderful in the frame- smooth and dark and blur and emotion and random chaos and compositional order.', '2015-07-01 10:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378946, 1155139, 12611, '<td valign="top">lovely structured and toned greens. you have achieved maximum depth.</td>', 'lovely structured and toned greens. you have achieved maximum depth.', '2015-07-01 10:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378947, 1156573, 12611, '<td valign="top">There is a prince in there somewhere-you have proven that much.</td>', 'There is a prince in there somewhere-you have proven that much.', '2015-07-01 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378949, 1156336, 12611, '<td valign="top">Thanks for bringing us the Frisco environs and waters of the bay, its objects and peoples.</td>', 'Thanks for bringing us the Frisco environs and waters of the bay, its objects and peoples.', '2015-07-01 10:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378950, 1156594, 12611, '<td valign="top">great tones and dead center placement. the power of black and white is clear through this shot.</td>', 'great tones and dead center placement. the power of black and white is clear through this shot.', '2015-07-01 10:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378956, 1156890, 12611, '<td valign="top">Mystery, light, darkness and depth-</td>', 'Mystery, light, darkness and depth-', '2015-07-01 10:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378958, 1156787, 12611, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful,  rugged sunset.</td>', 'That''s a beautiful,  rugged sunset.', '2015-07-01 10:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378960, 1156164, 12611, '<td valign="top">Some beautiful stillness and details in the frame. Can''t argue with your style bicycle photography in black and white.</td>', 'Some beautiful stillness and details in the frame. Can''t argue with your style bicycle photography in black and white.', '2015-07-01 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378962, 1156454, 12611, '<td valign="top">at least you have the UV filter on there.nicely done.</td>', 'at least you have the UV filter on there.nicely done.', '2015-07-01 10:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378965, 1157027, 12611, '<td valign="top">A beautifully lush scene, with a terrifically peaceful sky. The bold low key adds tremendous depth.</td>', 'A beautifully lush scene, with a terrifically peaceful sky. The bold low key adds tremendous depth.', '2015-07-01 10:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378969, 1155244, 12611, '<td valign="top">a beautifully secluded scene, from a terrific perspective.</td>', 'a beautifully secluded scene, from a terrific perspective.', '2015-07-01 10:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378970, 1155045, 12611, '<td valign="top">Helluva shot.</td>', 'Helluva shot.', '2015-07-01 10:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378971, 1156753, 12611, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene, whatever the type of boat!</td>', 'A beautiful scene, whatever the type of boat!', '2015-07-01 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378972, 1155377, 12611, '<td valign="top">Something so nice about this shot.</td>', 'Something so nice about this shot.', '2015-07-01 10:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378975, 1155974, 12611, '<td valign="top">people, playful drama, black and white and calculated blur- how can you go wrong?</td>', 'people, playful drama, black and white and calculated blur- how can you go wrong?', '2015-07-01 10:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378984, 1156858, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like how the thin cloud ties it all together (and the purple sky of course).</td>', 'I like how the thin cloud ties it all together (and the purple sky of course).', '2015-07-01 10:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378988, 1155187, 61396, '<td valign="top">great alignment of the elements</td>', 'great alignment of the elements', '2015-07-01 10:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378998, 1155049, 61396, '<td valign="top">top notch. just wondering if that''s an early morning or an afternoon image.</td>', 'top notch. just wondering if that''s an early morning or an afternoon image.', '2015-07-01 11:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7378999, 1156873, 61396, '<td valign="top">as she is about to escape the image, we are left to wonder what is out there.</td>', 'as she is about to escape the image, we are left to wonder what is out there.', '2015-07-01 11:06:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7379036, 1156393, 177322, '<td valign="top">What intrigues me about this image is that the leading line of the bridge, the direction of the walking people and the dog all point to the upper right of the frame.  Yet, the young man is looking down and to the left. For me, it imparts perfectly the subtle enigmas often ingrained in your work.  I think you chose well to use this image as a definition of you as a photographer.  Kudos.</td>', 'What intrigues me about this image is that the leading line of the bridge, the direction of the walking people and the dog all point to the upper right of the frame.  Yet, the young man is looking down and to the left. For me, it imparts perfectly the subtle enigmas often ingrained in your work.  I think you chose well to use this image as a definition of you as a photographer.  Kudos.', '2015-07-01 11:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379060, 1156711, 177322, '<td valign="top">While I am a foodie, I learned long ago that shooting food is a very challenging task.  What you achieve with your food shots is exceptional, in my opinion.  Such is the case with this luscious looking panna cotta; it is a perfect illustration of you as a photographer.  Bravo.<br/> <br/>My gracious just look at those flecks of vanilla in that cream!</td>', 'While I am a foodie, I learned long ago that shooting food is a very challenging task.  What you achieve with your food shots is exceptional, in my opinion.  Such is the case with this luscious looking panna cotta; it is a perfect illustration of you as a photographer.  Bravo. My gracious just look at those flecks of vanilla in that cream!', '2015-07-01 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379081, 1155049, 177322, '<td valign="top">Beautifully coquettish yet hauntingly aloof.<br/>Intimate yet remote.<br/>Folded in the womb yet encased in the coffin.<br/> <br/>What a perfect example of your work and all its mysteries.<br/> <br/>PS  Your exquisite model defines your work as much as your eye and processing. Regardless of the portrayal you ask of her, she is always stunning.</td>', 'Beautifully coquettish yet hauntingly aloof.Intimate yet remote.Folded in the womb yet encased in the coffin. What a perfect example of your work and all its mysteries. PS  Your exquisite model defines your work as much as your eye and processing. Regardless of the portrayal you ask of her, she is always stunning.', '2015-07-01 12:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379084, 1156985, 177322, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  What a rare catch, and I think it aptly captures your zest for life.  Good choice.</td>', 'Awesome!  What a rare catch, and I think it aptly captures your zest for life.  Good choice.', '2015-07-01 12:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379093, 1156657, 177322, '<td valign="top">This is so bizarre yet undeniably captivating.  Perhaps not reflective of your past works, but maybe a new vein of exploration after your success with "2.89" in the Abandoned Buildings IV challenge?  If so, I like it and would encourage you to continue this exploration of lighting the night in places filled with texture and character because you seem to have a talent for it.  Kudos.</td>', 'This is so bizarre yet undeniably captivating.  Perhaps not reflective of your past works, but maybe a new vein of exploration after your success with "2.89" in the Abandoned Buildings IV challenge?  If so, I like it and would encourage you to continue this exploration of lighting the night in places filled with texture and character because you seem to have a talent for it.  Kudos.', '2015-07-01 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379099, 1156914, 177322, '<td valign="top">Ah, the comradery of fellow photographers.  This is a very powerful image given the silhouettes and ribbons of vivid colors.  Good choice.</td>', 'Ah, the comradery of fellow photographers.  This is a very powerful image given the silhouettes and ribbons of vivid colors.  Good choice.', '2015-07-01 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379105, 1156773, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting pick. At first I wasn''t sure about the bit of tree on the right. But the more I look at it, it makes sense when part of the light house is cropped. It finishes things off. If it''s a rotating light, those are hard to catch! :)</td>', 'Interesting pick. At first I wasn''t sure about the bit of tree on the right. But the more I look at it, it makes sense when part of the light house is cropped. It finishes things off. If it''s a rotating light, those are hard to catch! :)', '2015-07-01 12:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379119, 1156393, 16148, '<td valign="top">You''re on the wrong side of the fence? Cunningly framed monochrome.</td>', 'You''re on the wrong side of the fence? Cunningly framed monochrome.', '2015-07-01 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379121, 1156393, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this one. The top part is so wonderful. I love the railing and the face looking down, but as I scanned down, the bottom part of the photo just didn''t stand up to the top. It''s weird, I don''t usually find photos that part almost mesmerizes me and the other part falls flat. Usually they flat part takes away from the other part and makes it just kind of "meh". It doesn''t in this case. For some reason, the person really intrigues me. I''m rambling, I know, I just wanted to leave some feedback, even if it doesn''t make sense. :)</td>', 'I really want to like this one. The top part is so wonderful. I love the railing and the face looking down, but as I scanned down, the bottom part of the photo just didn''t stand up to the top. It''s weird, I don''t usually find photos that part almost mesmerizes me and the other part falls flat. Usually they flat part takes away from the other part and makes it just kind of "meh". It doesn''t in this case. For some reason, the person really intrigues me. I''m rambling, I know, I just wanted to leave some feedback, even if it doesn''t make sense. :)', '2015-07-01 12:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379126, 1155974, 16148, '<td valign="top">The light and your processing have a wonderful glow.  I''d like a little more sky on top but that''s just nitpicking.  Beautiful candid moment.</td>', 'The light and your processing have a wonderful glow.  I''d like a little more sky on top but that''s just nitpicking.  Beautiful candid moment.', '2015-07-01 12:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379129, 1156164, 103142, '<td valign="top">I figured it had to be a spiffy shot. :)<br/> <br/>So I have mixed feelings on this one. I like it, but yet I''m finding it too static. I really wish there was a person in this, just off to the side, resting, or even partially off the page. My mom was into photography for awhile, and she said to always put a person in the photo, especially landscapes, etc. I thought she was crazy. But I''ve been seeing what she''s said. It just seems like this could have gone from a static, nice shot, to something awesome. 6 as is.</td>', 'I figured it had to be a spiffy shot. :) So I have mixed feelings on this one. I like it, but yet I''m finding it too static. I really wish there was a person in this, just off to the side, resting, or even partially off the page. My mom was into photography for awhile, and she said to always put a person in the photo, especially landscapes, etc. I thought she was crazy. But I''ve been seeing what she''s said. It just seems like this could have gone from a static, nice shot, to something awesome. 6 as is.', '2015-07-01 12:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379130, 1156858, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Some will dislike your crop but I like the depth it creates.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Some will dislike your crop but I like the depth it creates.', '2015-07-01 12:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379135, 1156933, 16148, '<td valign="top">Excellent  leading lines and I like your off center composition.  I''m wondering if you should have left more image on top.  Your crop seems a little tight but I don''t know what''s up there.  Nice!</td>', 'Excellent  leading lines and I like your off center composition.  I''m wondering if you should have left more image on top.  Your crop seems a little tight but I don''t know what''s up there.  Nice!', '2015-07-01 12:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379136, 1155244, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that seems close, but not quite right. The trees making the arch over the river -- especially with the reflection is so wonderful, I''m thinking if you would have cropped in from the left, or maybe better yet cropping in from the right, to really draw your eye to that part of the photo. When I look at that part, I see an enchanted waterway that I really want to take a kayak or canoe through to discover another world. But yet the rest of the photo seems to take away from that somehow. Maybe because the greens are bright and draw the eyes? I don''t know, but it''s so close...</td>', 'Another one that seems close, but not quite right. The trees making the arch over the river -- especially with the reflection is so wonderful, I''m thinking if you would have cropped in from the left, or maybe better yet cropping in from the right, to really draw your eye to that part of the photo. When I look at that part, I see an enchanted waterway that I really want to take a kayak or canoe through to discover another world. But yet the rest of the photo seems to take away from that somehow. Maybe because the greens are bright and draw the eyes? I don''t know, but it''s so close...', '2015-07-01 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379142, 1156914, 16148, '<td valign="top">The photographs captured are insignificant compered to this moment.  Enjoy the ride.</td>', 'The photographs captured are insignificant compered to this moment.  Enjoy the ride.', '2015-07-01 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379146, 1157025, 16148, '<td valign="top">This feels so spontaneous.  An image that found you.  Very nice!</td>', 'This feels so spontaneous.  An image that found you.  Very nice!', '2015-07-01 12:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379172, 1155213, 103142, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction was that I didn''t particularly like the old feel processing on this one. But as I looked more, I really liked the processing on the pieces. I like what it does to the background, and I like what it does to the flower. And it''s even nice on the bee. I''m not quite sure why the pieces aren''t coming together for the whole. The more I look at it, I''m wondering if it''s simply because the lower left corner is quite dark in comparison. Many times the old photos loose a lot of contrast. I think if the lower left quadrant was lighter, it would come together as a gorgeous whole.</td>', 'My initial reaction was that I didn''t particularly like the old feel processing on this one. But as I looked more, I really liked the processing on the pieces. I like what it does to the background, and I like what it does to the flower. And it''s even nice on the bee. I''m not quite sure why the pieces aren''t coming together for the whole. The more I look at it, I''m wondering if it''s simply because the lower left corner is quite dark in comparison. Many times the old photos loose a lot of contrast. I think if the lower left quadrant was lighter, it would come together as a gorgeous whole.', '2015-07-01 13:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379173, 1155514, 103142, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, I want a title for this one. (only strange, because I really don''t care for titles. Many times I only look at them after the fact or if I want more information on the photo. I like a photo to stand by itself and not rely on a title. That being said, this one makes me curious without one, and leaves me a bit unsettled. Part of the pose seems melancholy and lonely, but the being up on the toes makes it look a little too contrived to be very emotional. I feel like I''m missing something, and I wanted the pieces of the puzzle filled in. 7 as is, a little more natural I think would have been higher. Still not quite sure...</td>', 'Strangely enough, I want a title for this one. (only strange, because I really don''t care for titles. Many times I only look at them after the fact or if I want more information on the photo. I like a photo to stand by itself and not rely on a title. That being said, this one makes me curious without one, and leaves me a bit unsettled. Part of the pose seems melancholy and lonely, but the being up on the toes makes it look a little too contrived to be very emotional. I feel like I''m missing something, and I wanted the pieces of the puzzle filled in. 7 as is, a little more natural I think would have been higher. Still not quite sure...', '2015-07-01 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379192, 1156965, 61396, '<td valign="top">one must always stop and think for a moment when <a href="//s.ngm.com/2008/08/photo-contest/img/steinmetz-camel-shadows-615.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">looking at shadows from above</a>, and this is no exception. I like the separation between the wavy and calm water by the pier.</td>', 'one must always stop and think for a moment when looking at shadows from above, and this is no exception. I like the separation between the wavy and calm water by the pier.', '2015-07-01 13:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379196, 1156508, 61396, '<td valign="top">a genuine fingerprint image of yours (or maybe a footprint?)</td>', 'a genuine fingerprint image of yours (or maybe a footprint?)', '2015-07-01 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379202, 1156784, 61396, '<td valign="top">this is definitely you (and it is so detailed that one can learn you are wearing contact lenses). I like the facial expression (though I never know how much of it is artificially made in post)</td>', 'this is definitely you (and it is so detailed that one can learn you are wearing contact lenses). I like the facial expression (though I never know how much of it is artificially made in post)', '2015-07-01 13:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379206, 1157009, 61396, '<td valign="top">the joy of water games. great catch.</td>', 'the joy of water games. great catch.', '2015-07-01 13:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7379354, 1155974, 180331, '<td valign="top">My favorite. 9</td>', 'My favorite. 9', '2015-07-01 17:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
