(7380409, 1157033, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I miss talking with you. I hope our thread gets going again after DPL. You''ve taught me to look deeper at things, and this reminds me so much of you. The look on the woman''s face in the middle is marvelous. I''m not really sure what she''s looking at, but she''s deep in thought and seeing something that the rest of the world doesn''t see. <br/> <br/>That''s why I''m really glad to have gotten to know you. You see the world in a way that I don''t, and I''m learning more by seeing it through your eyes. Sometimes I don''t get it at all, sometimes it is like a flower unfolding. This fits wonderfully.</td>', 'Wonderful! I miss talking with you. I hope our thread gets going again after DPL. You''ve taught me to look deeper at things, and this reminds me so much of you. The look on the woman''s face in the middle is marvelous. I''m not really sure what she''s looking at, but she''s deep in thought and seeing something that the rest of the world doesn''t see.  That''s why I''m really glad to have gotten to know you. You see the world in a way that I don''t, and I''m learning more by seeing it through your eyes. Sometimes I don''t get it at all, sometimes it is like a flower unfolding. This fits wonderfully.', '2015-07-02 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
