(7380736, 1156933, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!   Reminds me (and gives me a wonderful feeling... THANKS BUNCHES) of the very first time I took my new lens out... and got my highest score ever... it was over an 8... I thought all week that my eyes were wrong and it was a 6.xx...   Ha!   but rollover didn''t happen on time... and it sank to 7.9892.   I''d never even had a 7... so was thrilled.  :D<br/> <br/>"At Day''s End"<br/> <br/>This is ... lovely.    I wish the woman weren''t so hit with light... so we could see her expression as she gives love.<br/> <br/>Beautiful.</td>', 'Fabulous!   Reminds me (and gives me a wonderful feeling... THANKS BUNCHES) of the very first time I took my new lens out... and got my highest score ever... it was over an 8... I thought all week that my eyes were wrong and it was a 6.xx...   Ha!   but rollover didn''t happen on time... and it sank to 7.9892.   I''d never even had a 7... so was thrilled.  :D "At Day''s End" This is ... lovely.    I wish the woman weren''t so hit with light... so we could see her expression as she gives love. Beautiful.', '2015-07-02 21:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7380738, 1156776, 103142, '<td valign="top">One of my daughter''s favorite animals. Fun catch. :)</td>', 'One of my daughter''s favorite animals. Fun catch. :)', '2015-07-02 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7380739, 1156955, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is not what I see when I think of your images, but I love the whimsical nature of this.  I always admire your simple, elegant touch.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is not what I see when I think of your images, but I love the whimsical nature of this.  I always admire your simple, elegant touch.  (voted earlier)', '2015-07-02 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
