(7381122, 1156978, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bohemka:</b></div><hr/><i> Please send me a link to what you''re doing with music. I''m in. Nice photo. I knew there was something heartfelt and interesting to this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m honored by your interest and really glad you like this photograph.<br/> <br/>It was heartfelt, indeed; I had the idea just before finishing reading the challenge description.<br/> <br/>I don''t have a website yet but I''ll start building it ASAP, for now there are only a few Live Music galleries (one of my interesting is to photograph music), feel free to check them out :)<br/>My website is in my profile <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=172697" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">waitingsilence</a> :)<br/> <br/>I also made the soundtrack for <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=109387" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">alexkc</a> timelapse video Twofold Nature <a href="https://vimeo.com/105968201" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://vimeo.com/105968201</a> !!<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-07-03 03:50:28.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by bohemka: Please send me a link to what you''re doing with music. I''m in. Nice photo. I knew there was something heartfelt and interesting to this.   I''m honored by your interest and really glad you like this photograph. It was heartfelt, indeed; I had the idea just before finishing reading the challenge description. I don''t have a website yet but I''ll start building it ASAP, for now there are only a few Live Music galleries (one of my interesting is to photograph music), feel free to check them out :)My website is in my profile  waitingsilence :) I also made the soundtrack for  alexkc timelapse video Twofold Nature https://vimeo.com/105968201 !! Cheers!', '2015-07-03 04:17:09.000000', '2015-07-03 04:50:28.000000', 0),
