(7381589, 1156336, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a typical Sea Scouts rowing craft, and you have quite a few of them with different organizations on SF Bay. Whether this one''s affiliated with Cal or not I couldn''t sy. Do you have another shot that shows better the graphic on the prow? Gave you an 8, BTW. We photographed youths trying to row a very similar boat unbder stern adult guidance at Kotor, Montenegro. They are universal :-)</td>', 'That''s a typical Sea Scouts rowing craft, and you have quite a few of them with different organizations on SF Bay. Whether this one''s affiliated with Cal or not I couldn''t sy. Do you have another shot that shows better the graphic on the prow? Gave you an 8, BTW. We photographed youths trying to row a very similar boat unbder stern adult guidance at Kotor, Montenegro. They are universal :-)', '2015-07-03 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
