(7381810, 1156987, 71489, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic! I kept going back and forth on your outtakes (which are equally wonderful) but great choice picking this one. The scene passing behind them quickly through the window gives the ''time passing by'' illusion very well. I''m in awe of this picture (and the outtakes)<br/> <br/>The camera you mentioned is fixed focus right, 23mm? Your subjects never seem to notice you when you take their pictures? In any of the pictures I saw they are all oblivious..<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1138003" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2035/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1138003.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2035/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1138003.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2035/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1138003.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1137987" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19825/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1137987.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19825/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1137987.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19825/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1137987.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1145687" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2080/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1145687.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2080/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1145687.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2080/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1145687.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Absolutely fantastic! I kept going back and forth on your outtakes (which are equally wonderful) but great choice picking this one. The scene passing behind them quickly through the window gives the ''time passing by'' illusion very well. I''m in awe of this picture (and the outtakes) The camera you mentioned is fixed focus right, 23mm? Your subjects never seem to notice you when you take their pictures? In any of the pictures I saw they are all oblivious..     ', '2015-07-04 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
