(7382368, 1156853, 102315, '<td valign="top">It''s funny that you stated that you did not think people would like the processing. It is vibrant but still seems natural. I came into this shot just to ask if you could send me a quick PM on your editing process? Is this all Photoshop? Do you use plug-in? I would love to know your steps.<br/> <br/>Also, processing aside this was a challenge for photographers to shoot "their" style and I knew this was yours the moment I saw it without reading the titel. You have done something not many on DPC have accomplished and that is to develop a style that is not only great but recognizable as your own. <br/> <br/>Very well deserved ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-07-05 20:50:32.</i></td>', 'It''s funny that you stated that you did not think people would like the processing. It is vibrant but still seems natural. I came into this shot just to ask if you could send me a quick PM on your editing process? Is this all Photoshop? Do you use plug-in? I would love to know your steps. Also, processing aside this was a challenge for photographers to shoot "their" style and I knew this was yours the moment I saw it without reading the titel. You have done something not many on DPC have accomplished and that is to develop a style that is not only great but recognizable as your own.  Very well deserved ribbon.', '2015-07-05 21:49:26.000000', '2015-07-05 21:50:32.000000', 0),
